      "writtenOn": "2025-09-16T08:25:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated the comment to be more clear that \"this is a container that may contain nothing\".\n\nOver in the `gfx::HDRMetadata` world, I passed around a bunch of `std::optional\u003cgfx::HDRMetadata\u003e`s at first, but that proved really cumbersome. That\u0027s what ended up informing this scheme.\n\n(And why in `skhdr::Metadata`, I don\u0027t expose what\u0027s actually stored, so I can maybe-in-the-future make it more lightweight by storing an `sk_sp\u003cSkData\u003e`).",
